      "username": "erp_jawahar",
      "name": "Jawahar",
      "created_at": "2026-02-19T04:24:58.542Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/asieftejani\">@asieftejani</a>, currently we maintain our records in Tally. Currently, we do manually Exporting records and importing into erpnext application. But for now, the tally record wants to sync automatically to our ERPNext without doing manually import and export</p>",
